10 REM STOP ENDS THE RUN; GOTO AND IF MAY TARGET REM AND DATA LINES
20 GOTO 50
30 PRINT "NOT REACHED"
50 REM ARRIVED HERE BY GOTO
60 PRINT "AT 60"
70 IF 1 < 2 THEN 90
80 PRINT "NOT REACHED"
90 DATA 1, 2, 3
100 PRINT "AFTER DATA"
110 GOSUB 200
120 PRINT "BEFORE STOP"
130 STOP
140 PRINT "NOT REACHED"
200 REM SUBROUTINE
210 PRINT "IN SUBROUTINE"
220 RETURN
230 END
